<title>USA: Custom Chrome approves share buy plan.</title>
<headline>Custom Chrome approves share buy plan.</headline>
<dateline>MORGAN HILL, Calif. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Custom Chrome Inc said on Tuesday its board has authorized a stock purchase program of up to 300,000 shares of its common stock in the open market from time to time.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said the decision was made in view of the stock's recent price range. Custom Chrome shares were off 1/8 at 16-3/8, near the bottom of its 52 week high range of 16-1/4 to 27-7/8.</p>
<p>Also, the company, an independent supplier of aftermarket parts and accessories for Harley-Davidson Inc motorcycles, said it intends to use the stock in connection with employee incentive stock plans.</p>
